  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.MessageLinked(LinkNumber: number, Number: number, Text: string | uuid, ID: string | uuid)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llMessageLinked(integer LinkNumber, integer Number, string Text, key ID);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The purpose of this function is to allow scripts in the same object to communicate. It triggers a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Link_message" target="_blank">link_message</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Event" target="_blank">event</a> with the same parameters <b>num</b>, <b>str</b>, and <b>id</b> in all scripts in the prim(s) described by <b>link</b>.</p>
</p>
